---
// End-of-post author card. Badge, not the headshot (the photo lives on
// /about/ only).
---

<aside class="author" aria-label="About the author" data-author-card>
  <a class="badge-link" href="/about/" aria-label="About Corey Wininger" tabindex="-1">
    <span class="keycap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="gt">&gt;</span>_</span>
  </a>
  <div class="who">
    <a class="name" href="/about/">Corey Wininger</a>
    <p>Director of Operations. I write about running IT, explaining it to the business, and where AI actually helps.</p>
  </div>
  <a class="btn-ghost more" href="/about/" data-author-more>More about me</a>
</aside>

<style>
  .author {
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line2);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--surface), var(--surface2));
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .badge-link { flex: none; text-decoration: none; }
  .keycap {
    --badge: 84px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--bg);
    font-size: 30px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
  }
  .author:hover .keycap { transform: rotate(-6deg); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .who { flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; }
  .name {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 150ms ease;
  }
  .name:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  p { margin: 0; color: var(--text2); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .more { flex: none; }
</style>
